# AWS Cloud Deployment

## Architecture Overview

```
Client (HTTPS)
  │
  ▼
API Gateway REST API (vsioyo4f63)
  ├── Cognito JWT authorizer on protected routes
  ├── Stage-level rate limiting (100 req/s, 50 burst)
  ├── Response streaming enabled for SSE endpoints
  ├── Gateway Responses use dynamic origin: method.request.header.origin
  │
  ▼ (VPC Link V2 → u28esw)
Internal ALB (uf-scheduler, port 80)
  ├── SG: sg-06b85c2938915a943 (inbound 80 from 0.0.0.0/0, outbound 8000 to sg-ecs + 80 to self)
  ├── Target group: tg-course-assistant (ip type, port 8000, health check /health)
  ├── Sticky sessions enabled (3600s)
  │
  ▼
ECS Fargate (uf-scheduler-cluster / uf-course-assistant-service)
  ├── Task: uf-course-assistant (512 CPU, 1024 MiB)
  ├── Container port 8000 (uvicorn)
  ├── SG: sg-0165c16040d8aa25a (inbound 8000 from sg-alb only, outbound all)
  ├── Subnets: subnet-09727e31069780929 (us-east-1a), subnet-0d4559928365b50b6 (us-east-1b)
  ├── assignPublicIp: ENABLED (default VPC public subnets → IGW for outbound)
  └── Secrets injected from SSM Parameter Store at /uf-course-assistant/*
```

